![Goldfieber 01](/images/legacy-v2/47/47c46694f2eab505b6831007ddcec528-w1600-q78.webp)

Das Plakat 2022

![Goldfieber 02](/images/legacy-v2/a9/a94f1c90696efda73a3ccc8b4564fa94-w1600-q78.webp)

